<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>E-Tag Management — Red Tag / White Tag / M-Tag</title>
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#f4f7fb; --card:#fff; --ink:#172033; --muted:#6b7280; --line:#e5eaf1;
  --navy:#0f172a; --blue:#2563eb; --blue2:#eff6ff; --red:#dc2626; --red2:#fef2f2;
  --green:#059669; --green2:#ecfdf5; --amber:#d97706; --amber2:#fffbeb;
  --shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(15,23,42,.07); --radius:18px;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box} body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink)}
button,input,select,textarea{font:inherit} button{cursor:pointer}
.app{display:flex;min-height:100vh}
.sidebar{width:250px;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;padding:24px 16px;position:fixed;inset:0 auto 0 0;z-index:10}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:8px 10px 28px}
.logo{width:50px;height:50px;border-radius:13px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.18)}
.toyota-logo img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}
.brand strong{display:block;font-size:15px}.brand span{display:block;color:#94a3b8;font-size:11px;margin-top:3px}
.nav{display:grid;gap:7px}.nav button{border:0;background:transparent;color:#cbd5e1;text-align:left;padding:12px 13px;border-radius:11px;display:flex;gap:11px;align-items:center}
.nav button.active,.nav button:hover{background:#1e293b;color:#fff}.nav .ico{width:20px;text-align:center}
.side-note{position:absolute;bottom:20px;left:20px;right:20px;border:1px solid #334155;background:#111c2f;border-radius:14px;padding:12px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:11px;line-height:1.5}
.main{margin-left:250px;width:calc(100% - 250px);padding:26px 30px}
.topbar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:24px}
.kicker{font-size:12px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.09em}.title{font-size:28px;font-weight:850;margin:5px 0}.subtitle{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
.actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.btn{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;color:var(--ink);padding:10px 13px;border-radius:11px;font-weight:700}.btn.primary{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:#fff}.btn.danger{color:var(--red);background:#fff}.btn.small{padding:7px 9px;font-size:12px}
.page{display:none}.page.active{display:block}
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px;margin-bottom:18px}
.stat{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.stat .label{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700}.stat .num{font-size:29px;font-weight:850;margin-top:7px}.stat .hint{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.35fr .65fr;gap:18px}.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:19px}
.card h3{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:16px}.card .desc{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-bottom:16px}
.tag-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}.tag-card{border-radius:16px;padding:18px;border:1px solid var(--line)}.tag-card.red{background:var(--red2);border-color:#fecaca}.tag-card.white{background:#f8fafc}.tag-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.pill{font-size:10px;font-weight:850;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff}.red .pill{color:var(--red)}.white .pill{color:#475569}.tag-card h4{margin:11px 0 4px}.tag-card p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}
.quick{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}.quick button{border:1px dashed #cbd5e1;background:#fff;border-radius:13px;padding:13px;text-align:left;font-weight:750}.quick button span{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500;font-size:11px;margin-top:4px}
.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:12px;margin-bottom:15px}.section-head h2{margin:0;font-size:20px}.section-head p{margin:4px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}
.form-card{max-width:900px}.form-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}.field{display:grid;gap:7px}.field.full{grid-column:1/-1}.field label{font-size:12px;font-weight:800}.field input,.field select,.field textarea{width:100%;border:1px solid #dbe2ea;background:#fff;border-radius:11px;padding:11px 12px;outline:none}.field textarea{min-height:110px;resize:vertical}.field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{border-color:#93c5fd;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #dbeafe}
.form-actions{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:9px;margin-top:17px}
.filters{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:13px}.filters input,.filters select{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:#fff;padding:9px 11px}
.table-wrap{overflow:auto}.table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px}.table th{background:#f8fafc;text-align:left;color:#64748b;font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em}.table th,.table td{padding:12px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top}.table td strong{font-size:12px}.empty{text-align:center;padding:45px 15px;color:var(--muted)}
.badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:999px;font-size:10px;font-weight:800}.badge.red{background:var(--red2);color:var(--red)}.badge.white{background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569}.badge.green{background:var(--green2);color:var(--green)}.badge.amber{background:var(--amber2);color:var(--amber)}
.report-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:18px}.report-preview{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:15px;padding:22px;background:#fff}.report-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;border-bottom:2px solid #0f172a;padding-bottom:13px;margin-bottom:18px}.report-head h2{margin:0;font-size:22px}.report-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px 1fr;gap:10px;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed #e2e8f0;font-size:12px}.report-row b{color:#475569}
.toast{position:fixed;right:22px;bottom:22px;background:#111827;color:#fff;padding:12px 15px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px);transition:.25s;pointer-events:none;font-size:12px;z-index:30}.toast.show{opacity:1;transform:none}

.map-shell{background:#e8edf3;border:1px solid #d7dee8;border-radius:16px;padding:10px;overflow:auto}
.map-canvas{position:relative;width:100%;min-width:900px;aspect-ratio:2048/1467;background:#fff;border-radius:11px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(15,23,42,.12)}
.factory-map{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:fill}
.map-zone,.post-zone{position:absolute;border:2px solid transparent;background:rgba(37,99,235,.01);border-radius:6px;color:transparent;transition:.16s;z-index:3;padding:0}
.map-zone:hover,.map-zone.selected{background:rgba(37,99,235,.16);border-color:#2563eb;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(37,99,235,.12)}
.map-zone span,.post-zone span{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);white-space:nowrap;background:rgba(15,23,42,.9);color:#fff;padding:6px 9px;border-radius:7px;font-size:10px;font-weight:850;opacity:0;pointer-events:none}
.map-zone:hover span,.map-zone.selected span,.post-zone:hover span,.post-zone.selected span{opacity:1}
.post-zone{border:2px solid rgba(37,99,235,.18);background:rgba(37,99,235,.015);z-index:4}
.post-zone:hover,.post-zone.selected{background:rgba(37,99,235,.22);border-color:#2563eb;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(37,99,235,.15)}
.line-moulding{left:25%;top:6%;width:68%;height:8%}
.line-ppc{left:1%;top:8%;width:10%;height:48%}
.line-core{right:1%;top:24%;width:8%;height:48%}
.line-taman{left:17%;bottom:19%;width:31%;height:9%}
.line-metal{left:1%;bottom:19%;width:10%;height:24%}

/* POST coordinates follow the white/blue boxed POST labels in the supplied map */
.post-junbiki{left:11%;top:14%;width:19%;height:7%}
.post-crank{left:26%;top:22%;width:20%;height:7%}
.post-auto{left:45%;top:29%;width:14%;height:7%}
.post-ko1{left:64%;top:25%;width:16%;height:7%}
.post-ko2{left:69%;top:39%;width:16%;height:7%}
.post-spray{left:13%;top:30%;width:13%;height:8%}
.post-quality{left:26%;top:45%;width:14%;height:6%}
.post-final{left:36%;top:45%;width:13%;height:6%}
.post-hanten{left:47%;top:45%;width:12%;height:6%}
.post-hsb{left:55%;top:43%;width:16%;height:8%}
.post-repair{left:21%;top:50%;width:9%;height:7%}
.post-metal{left:2%;top:62%;width:10%;height:8%}

.map-legend{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px}
.map-filter{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:999px;padding:7px 10px;font-size:11px;font-weight:750}
.map-filter:hover,.map-filter.active{background:var(--blue2);border-color:#93c5fd;color:var(--blue)}
.post-list{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:9px;align-items:center}
.post-list-title{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#64748b;margin-right:2px}
.field .link-note{font-size:10px;color:#2563eb;margin-top:-2px}

.map-zone.has-problem,.post-zone.has-problem{
  border-color:#dc2626 !important;
  background:rgba(220,38,38,.18) !important;
  box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(220,38,38,.15),0 0 18px rgba(220,38,38,.35);
  animation:problemPulse 1.6s infinite;
}
.post-zone.has-problem span:first-child{
  background:#dc2626 !important;color:#fff !important;border-color:#dc2626 !important;
}
.problem-count{
  position:absolute;right:-10px;top:-10px;z-index:8;
  min-width:24px;height:24px;padding:0 6px;border-radius:999px;
  display:none;place-items:center;background:#dc2626;color:#fff;
  border:3px solid #fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:950;
  box-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(15,23,42,.25);
}
.has-problem .problem-count{display:grid}
@keyframes problemPulse{
  0%,100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(220,38,38,.12),0 0 12px rgba(220,38,38,.18)}
  50%{box-shadow:0 0 0 7px rgba(220,38,38,.05),0 0 25px rgba(220,38,38,.4)}
}
.problem-summary{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px;align-items:center}
.problem-summary .mini{
  border:1px solid #fecaca;background:#fff5f5;color:#b91c1c;
  border-radius:10px;padding:7px 9px;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;
}
.post-swing{left:67%;top:25%;width:15%;height:8%}

@media(max-width:1000px){.stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.grid,.report-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
@media(max-width:760px){.sidebar{width:70px;padding:14px 9px}.brand div:not(.logo),.nav button span:not(.ico),.side-note{display:none}.main{margin-left:70px;width:calc(100% - 70px);padding:18px}.topbar{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.form-grid,.tag-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.field.full{grid-column:auto}}

.photo-upload{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.photo-upload input[type=file]{border:1px dashed #cbd5e1;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:10px;padding:10px;width:100%;font-size:11px}
.photo-preview{display:none;max-width:100%;max-height:220px;object-fit:contain;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:12px;background:#f8fafc;padding:4px}
.photo-preview.show{display:block}
.report-photo{margin-top:14px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:14px}
.report-photo img{display:block;width:100%;max-height:320px;object-fit:contain;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f8fafc}
.photo-caption{font-size:10px;color:#64748b;margin-top:6px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app">
<aside class="sidebar">
  <div class="brand"><div class="logo toyota-logo"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Toyota"></div><div><strong>E-Tag Management</strong><span>Problem Management</span></div></div>
  <nav class="nav">
    <button class="active" data-page="dashboard"><span class="ico">▦</span><span>Dashboard</span></button>
    <button data-page="red"><span class="ico">🔴</span><span>Red Tag</span></button>
    <button data-page="white"><span class="ico">⚪</span><span>White Tag</span></button>
    <button data-page="report"><span class="ico">📋</span><span>M-Tag / Report</span></button>
    <button data-page="records"><span class="ico">☷</span><span>Data Temuan</span></button>
  </nav>
  <div class="side-note">Area awal dari file Excel: <b>FINISHING LINE</b>.<br>Data tersimpan di database bersama dan tersinkronisasi antar-device.</div>
</aside>

<main class="main">
  <div class="topbar">
    <div><div class="kicker">Finishing Line</div><div class="title">E-Tag Management</div><div class="subtitle">Sistem digital untuk pencatatan temuan, request perbaikan, dan laporan countermeasure.</div></div>
    <div class="actions"><button class="btn" id="exportBtn">Download Excel</button><button class="btn primary" onclick="openForm('red')">+ Temuan Baru</button></div>
  </div>

  <section id="dashboard" class="page active">
    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat"><div class="label">TOTAL TEMUAN</div><div class="num" id="statTotal">0</div><div class="hint">Semua Red + White Tag</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="label">RED TAG</div><div class="num" id="statRed">0</div><div class="hint">Tidak bisa ditanggulangi langsung</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="label">WHITE TAG</div><div class="num" id="statWhite">0</div><div class="hint">Bisa ditanggulangi langsung</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="label">M-TAG</div><div class="num" id="statReport">0</div><div class="hint">Laporan countermeasure</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:18px">
      <div class="section-head" style="margin-bottom:12px">
        <div>
          <h3>Mapping Area Pabrik</h3>
          <p>Klik <b>Line</b> atau setiap <b>POST</b> yang diberi kotak pada map untuk memfilter data temuan.</p>
        </div>
        <span id="mappingSelected" class="badge" style="background:var(--blue2);color:var(--blue)">Semua Area</span>
      </div>

      <div class="map-shell">
        <div class="map-canvas" id="mapCanvas">
          <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Factory Mapping" class="factory-map">

          <!-- Line clickable areas -->
          <button class="map-zone line-moulding" data-map="Moulding Line" title="Moulding Line"><span>Moulding Line</span></button>
          <button class="map-zone line-ppc" data-map="PPC Line" title="PPC Line"><span>PPC Line</span></button>
          <button class="map-zone line-core" data-map="Core Making Line" title="Core Making Line"><span>Core Making Line</span></button>
          <button class="map-zone line-taman" data-map="Taman Qualitas" title="Taman Qualitas"><span>Taman Qualitas</span></button>
          <button class="map-zone line-metal" data-map="Metalicone" title="Metalicone"><span>Metalicone</span></button>

          <!-- Clickable POST boxes from the user's map -->
          <button class="post-zone post-junbiki" data-map="POST JUNBIKI" title="POST JUNBIKI"><span>POST JUNBIKI</span><span class="problem-count">0</span></button>
          <button class="post-zone post-crank" data-map="POST CRANK/CAM" title="POST CRANK/CAM"><span>POST CRANK/CAM</span><span class="problem-count">0</span></button>
          <button class="post-zone post-auto" data-map="POST AUTO GRINDING" title="POST AUTO GRINDING"><span>POST AUTO GRINDING</span><span class="problem-count">0</span></button>
          <button class="post-zone post-swing" data-map="POST SWING GRINDA" title="POST SWING GRINDA"><span>POST SWING GRINDA</span><span class="problem-count">0</span></button>
          <button class="post-zone post-ko1" data-map="POST KO & BARITORI" title="POST KO & BARITORI"><span>POST KO & BARITORI</span><span class="problem-count">0</span></button>
          <button class="post-zone post-ko2" data-map="POST KO & BARITORI" title="POST KO & BARITORI"><span>POST KO & BARITORI</span><span class="problem-count">0</span></button>
          <button class="post-zone post-spray" data-map="POST SPRAYBOOTH" title="POST SPRAYBOOTH"><span>POST SPRAYBOOTH</span><span class="problem-count">0</span></button>
          <button class="post-zone post-quality" data-map="POST QUALITY GATE" title="POST QUALITY GATE"><span>POST QUALITY GATE</span><span class="problem-count">0</span></button>
          <button class="post-zone post-final" data-map="POST FINAL PRO" title="POST FINAL PRO"><span>POST FINAL PRO</span><span class="problem-count">0</span></button>
          <button class="post-zone post-hanten" data-map="POST HANTEN" title="POST HANTEN"><span>POST HANTEN</span><span class="problem-count">0</span></button>
          <button class="post-zone post-hsb" data-map="POST HSB" title="POST HSB"><span>POST HSB</span><span class="problem-count">0</span></button>
          <button class="post-zone post-repair" data-map="POST REPAIR" title="POST REPAIR"><span>POST REPAIR</span><span class="problem-count">0</span></button>
          <button class="post-zone post-metal" data-map="POST METALICONE" title="POST METALICONE"><span>POST METALICONE</span><span class="problem-count">0</span></button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="mapProblemSummary" class="problem-summary"></div>
      <div class="map-legend">
        <button class="map-filter active" data-map-filter="">All Area</button>
        <button class="map-filter" data-map-filter="Moulding Line">Moulding Line</button>
        <button class="map-filter" data-map-filter="PPC Line">PPC Line</button>
        <button class="map-filter" data-map-filter="Core Making Line">Core Making Line</button>
        <button class="map-filter" data-map-filter="Taman Qualitas">Taman Qualitas</button>
        <button class="map-filter" data-map-filter="Metalicone">Metalicone</button>
      </div>
      <div class="post-list">
        <span class="post-list-title">Pilih POST:</span>
        <button class="map-filter post-filter" data-map-filter="POST JUNBIKI">POST JUNBIKI</button>
        <button class="map-filter post-filter" data-map-filter="POST CRANK/CAM">POST CRANK/CAM</button>
        <button class="map-filter post-filter" data-map-filter="POST AUTO GRINDING">POST AUTO GRINDING</button>
        <button class="map-filter post-filter" data-map-filter="POST KO & BARITORI 1">POST KO & BARITORI 1</button>
        <button class="map-filter post-filter" data-map-filter="POST KO & BARITORI 2">POST KO & BARITORI 2</button>
        <button class="map-filter post-filter" data-map-filter="POST SPRAYBOOTH">POST SPRAYBOOTH</button>
        <button class="map-filter post-filter" data-map-filter="POST QUALITY GATE">POST QUALITY GATE</button>
        <button class="map-filter post-filter" data-map-filter="POST FINAL PRO">POST FINAL PRO</button>
        <button class="map-filter post-filter" data-map-filter="POST HANTEN">POST HANTEN</button>
        <button class="map-filter post-filter" data-map-filter="POST HSB">POST HSB</button>
        <button class="map-filter post-filter" data-map-filter="POST REPAIR">POST REPAIR</button>
        <button class="map-filter post-filter" data-map-filter="POST METALICONE">POST METALICONE</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card"><h3>Alur Penanganan Problem</h3><div class="desc">Dibuat mengikuti struktur workbook yang Anda kirim.</div>
        <div class="tag-grid">
          <div class="tag-card red"><div class="tag-head"><span class="pill">RED TAG</span><span>01</span></div><h4>Problem membutuhkan bantuan</h4><p>Untuk temuan yang tidak bisa ditanggulangi secara langsung. Dicatat, ditentukan PIC/request perbaikan, lalu dipantau.</p><button class="btn small" onclick="openForm('red')">Input Red Tag →</button></div>
          <div class="tag-card white"><div class="tag-head"><span class="pill">WHITE TAG</span><span>02</span></div><h4>Problem bisa langsung ditangani</h4><p>Untuk temuan yang dapat ditanggulangi langsung di line. Tetap dicatat agar histori perbaikan terdokumentasi.</p><button class="btn small" onclick="openForm('white')">Input White Tag →</button></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Quick Actions</h3><div class="desc">Akses cepat untuk operator / leader.</div>
        <div class="quick"><button onclick="openForm('red')">🔴 Red Tag<span>Catat problem kritis / belum bisa ditangani</span></button><button onclick="openForm('white')">⚪ White Tag<span>Catat problem yang langsung selesai</span></button><button onclick="showPage('records')">☷ Data Temuan<span>Lihat histori dan filter data</span></button><button onclick="openForm('report')">📋 M-Tag<span>Buat laporan countermeasure</span></button></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="red" class="page"><div class="section-head"><div><h2>Red Tag — Temuan Line</h2><p>Temuan yang tidak bisa ditanggulangi secara langsung.</p></div></div>
    <div class="card form-card"><form id="redForm"><div class="form-grid">
      <div class="field full"><label>Nama Temuan *</label><input name="nama" required placeholder="Contoh: Sensor conveyor tidak membaca produk"></div>
      <div class="field"><label>Tanggal *</label><input type="date" name="tanggal" required></div>
      <div class="field"><label>Temuan di *</label><select name="lokasi" required>
<option value="">— Pilih POST / lokasi —</option>
<option value="POST JUNBIKI">POST JUNBIKI</option>
<option value="POST CRANK/CAM">POST CRANK/CAM</option>
<option value="POST AUTO GRINDING">POST AUTO GRINDING</option>
<option value="POST SWING GRINDA">POST SWING GRINDA</option>
<option value="POST KO & BARITORI">POST KO & BARITORI</option>
<option value="POST SPRAYBOOTH">POST SPRAYBOOTH</option>
<option value="POST QUALITY GATE">POST QUALITY GATE</option>
<option value="POST FINAL PRO">POST FINAL PRO</option>
<option value="POST HANTEN">POST HANTEN</option>
<option value="POST HSB">POST HSB</option>
<option value="POST REPAIR">POST REPAIR</option>
<option value="POST METALICONE">POST METALICONE</option>
</select></div>
      <div class="field"><label>Penemu *</label><input name="penemu" required placeholder="Nama operator / leader"></div>
